criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Unassisted single pregnancy;
* Age between 18 and 50 years old;
* Fasting blood glucose \<92 mg/dl in the first gestational blood test;
* First trimester ultrasound before the 12th gestational week.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Multiple or assisted pregnancies;
* Any pregestational illness or pregestational treatment that may affect pregnancy;
* Known intolerance/allergy to any component of the nutritional intervention.
